    narr:narration """The architectural trajectory is defined by the [adoption of Zypherion](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_1) for the analytics pipeline, a decision framed by [quantified performance expectations](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_2) and a [firm migration timeline](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_3). This shift is presented as a high-conviction move, with the rationale and schedule [formally codified](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_4) into the organizational record. The narrative structure [links the technical justification](narr:Narrative_PerformanceJustifiedAdoption) directly to the execution plan, emphasizing both the 15x performance gain and the Q3 2026 start date as the primary drivers for the transition.""" ;
